  // A filter is no longer ONE report-wide global; it is a *card* (block with an
  // inner [data-report-filter] host) carrying a `scope` ∈ {global, tab}. Global
  // cards control every block (merged view). A tab card controls only the blocks
  // in the tab where the card sits (both merged + split). In split (分页) view,
  // global cards are ignored + hidden so each tab is independently filterable;
