  // ===== Single-grid 页签 (tab-card) model ==============================
  // A 页签 report renders ONE continuous grid; each section's narrative band is
  // a 页签 card ([data-tab-card] / component section-tab). The top bar is DERIVED
  // from these cards in grid order. Tab membership (data-block-tab) = the nearest
  // preceding card; blocks before the first card are the overview head. Dragging a
  // 页签 card re-orders the top bar + renumbers every card (note 2).
  var __activeTab='overview';
